          <text>What can I expect after I apply?</text>
        </ezobject:attribute>
        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="2123" ezremote:identifier="description" name="Description" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/">
            <paragraph>After you apply for a job at Bold Agency, you can expect to receive a call from one of our friendly and knowledgeable recruitment specialists. They will ask you questions about your experience and skillset, and will match you with the perfect job for your qualifications. You can also expect to receive guidance and support throughout the application process, as well as career advice and tips from our team of experts.</paragraph>
          </section>
